heretic-guide-blade-damage = [bold]Damage:[/bold]
heretic-guide-blade-rate = [color=#7a8290]attacks per second: { $rate }[/color]
heretic-guide-blade-no-damage = Damage not set in prototype.
heretic-guide-blade-no-bonus = This blade has no special properties.

heretic-guide-blade-bonus-ash = At tier 7 the blade [color=#d08770]ignites[/color] those you hit.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-blade = At tier 7 you can channel a grasp into the blade, doubling its damage. Anyone who tries to pick it up gets stunned. Two blades in hand strike twice per swing.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-flesh = At tier 7 the blade causes [color=#bf616a]heavy bleeding[/color]. Ghouls, unlike all other outsiders, wield it at full power.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-void = At tier 7 the blade [color=#88c0d0]freezes[/color] enemies. You can activate a blade in hand to teleport to a marked target without breaking the blade.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-rust = At tier 7 the blade adds [color=#a3844e]poison damage[/color]. Against marked victims it also breaks what they hold.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-cosmos = At tier 7 the blade marks victims with a star sigil and reaches marked targets [color=#b48ead]at range[/color]. Hits on different targets stack into a combo that finishes off previous victims.
heretic-guide-blade-bonus-lock = At tier 7 the blade hits harder: +5 slash and +5 structural damage.

heretic-guide-behavior-Sacrifice = the target from your list must lie on the rune, in crit or dead
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionAsh = three burning corpses on the rune at the time of the ritual
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionBlade = three corpses on the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionFlesh = four corpses on the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionVoid = three corpses on the rune, and the temperature must be below -20 or vacuum
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionRust = three rotting or silicon corpses on the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-AscensionCosmos = three star-marked corpses on the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeFlesh = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-ImperfectRitual = a corpse must lie on the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-RawRitual = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-LonelyRitual = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-RustedRitual = a vomit puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-RitualOfKnowledge = four random items, the list is given by the knowledge itself and changes after each ritual
heretic-guide-behavior-Reminiscence = you must have a lost blade, otherwise there is nothing to return
heretic-guide-behavior-FeastOfOwls = you permanently give up ascension, this cannot be undone
heretic-guide-behavior-RitualPhylacteryOfDamnation = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-RitualEtherOfTheNewborn = a vomit puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeAsh = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeBlade = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeVoid = the temperature around the rune must be below zero or vacuum
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeRust = a rust puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-BladeCosmos = a blood puddle must be under the rune
heretic-guide-behavior-RitualBladeLock = a blood puddle must be under the rune

